              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a katana. May have Samurai armour (+4 pts), longbow (+3 pts), naginata (+2 pts), spear (+2 pts), additional hand weapon (+2 pts), horse (free, increases Movement to 8"). Independent Character. Warrior of Legend, Honourable and stubborn. 0-7. Designer's Note: if you don't know why the number of heroes is limited to seven then shame (and I do mean shame) on you! (Armies of Antiquity p.45)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
