              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a katana. May have Samurai armour (+4 pts), longbow (+3 pts), spear (+2 pts), additional hand weapon (+2 pts). Honourable and stubborn. Any Samurai or Ashigaru unit may carry Sashimonos for +15 pts per unit (not built, add by hand). (Armies of Antiquity p.45)</characteristic>
