            <profile id="2f82-2124-23f6-640c" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="aab0-aa1e-0319-4ffe" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Exotic weapons (count as additional hand weapons). May replace exotic weapons with spear or naginata (no additional cost). Skirmishers. Warrior monks receive a 5+ special "dodge" save that is not modified by the strength of their opponent's attack. 0-1. (Armies of Antiquity p.45)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
